# {{FACTORY}} — ontology

**Version:** 0.1.0
**Owns:** the canonical vocabulary of this factory. One term, one meaning.

Every term below is the **only** word allowed for that concept — in code, in
ADRs, in issue titles, in reports, in chat. Anything in the banned column is a
defect to fix, not a synonym to tolerate.

> Why this file exists: the same concept under three names makes reports
> unreadable and `grep` useless. Drift starts on day one and is never cheaper
> to fix later.

