## Naming law

| Artifact | Pattern | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Work-unit topic | `Worker — #N <title>` | `Worker — #14 session_notify alerts` |
| Closed topic | `Done — #N <title>` | `Done — #14 session_notify alerts` |
| Issue | `<prefix>: <statement>` | `probe: rank basis is undocumented` |
| Decision record | `NNNN-<slug>` | `0003-authoritative-state-writer` |

Rename on close; never re-create. The topic id is stable and is what a cron's
`deliver_to` points at.
